                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6cd2c24f-2867-3bad-96d1-27aa5bb41061",
                        "entry_id": "f35bcd4f-a2ad-38fd-814f-c36c6ffd249d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Relatif au premier âge d'une personne, entre sa naissance et ses tout premiers souvenirs."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Pédiatrie"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "85e33ed5-d72b-4c96-a95d-ee146af8d4a0",
                                "sense_id": "6cd2c24f-2867-3bad-96d1-27aa5bb41061",
                                "text": "Titre du livre La Santé primale. Comment se construit et se cultive la santé, de Michel Odent, éditions Payot, 1986."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2450afa3-3501-42c9-9e9f-90fc9a7cbd07",
                                "sense_id": "6cd2c24f-2867-3bad-96d1-27aa5bb41061",
                                "text": "Dr Michel Odent, chirurgien et obstétricien, […] fonde à Londres, en 1986, le Primal Health Research Centre dont le but est d'étudier les conséquences des événements qui se déroulent durant la période primale (de la conception au premier anniversaire) sur la santé et le comportement de l'enfant et de l'adulte qu'il deviendra. — (mercredi 22 avril 2009, ERGOBABY Europe/Berlin)."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ee125927-691a-3ee6-82ab-a7f61fa1197f",
                        "entry_id": "f35bcd4f-a2ad-38fd-814f-c36c6ffd249d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui concerne la remémoration du patient qui revit son passé."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c4fd6854-8575-46f2-a93e-0e3a1b45767f",
                                "sense_id": "ee125927-691a-3ee6-82ab-a7f61fa1197f",
                                "text": "La thérapie primale est une des découvertes les plus importantes dans l’histoire de la psychothérapie et changera le cours de la psychologie et sa pratique pour les générations futures."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e58bbd2b-8927-4bcd-9ee7-19b94623cbc9",
                                "sense_id": "ee125927-691a-3ee6-82ab-a7f61fa1197f",
                                "text": "Pas question de fixer des limites extrêmes comme dans le livre, mais plutôt de satisfaire ses envies « primales »."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "056e5573-98ce-4a27-9d5d-768ecb27e108",
                        "source_entry_id": "f35bcd4f-a2ad-38fd-814f-c36c6ffd249d",
                        "source_sense_description": "En psychologie",
                        "target_lang_word": "primal",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "primal",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3980f0a5-305d-3840-af60-21e1f55dabd9",
                                        "entry_id": "65a6287d-f3aa-3293-a634-175212fc2468",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Being the first in time or in history."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2bda91a2-8ce6-4f9a-9cbc-575badcd0259",
                                                "sense_id": "3980f0a5-305d-3840-af60-21e1f55dabd9",
                                                "text": "primal man"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6a28e526-45d9-3830-8f94-0189949310c6",
                                        "entry_id": "65a6287d-f3aa-3293-a634-175212fc2468",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of greatest importance; primary."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4b15e1f7-7f9d-4fc4-9208-a3bcb0d86e13",
                                                "sense_id": "6a28e526-45d9-3830-8f94-0189949310c6",
                                                "text": "The most primal motion of all, of course, is vertical—a steady eternal fall into the infinity of space; speed cannot be ascribed to them, since, given the infinity of space and the absolute steadiness of the fall, no [relative] standard for it exists at all."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dee4a4c2-091e-4ec4-85a3-8441373b6543",
                                                "sense_id": "6a28e526-45d9-3830-8f94-0189949310c6",
                                                "text": "“We don’t know what life is. We do know what death is. It is change of habitat of ghost. I wish we had some sepate or house of bishops to tabulate these concepts. The law of togetherness and apartness is the most primal concept of life, Hence a crystal belongs as legitimately to the sphere of life as any seraph that blazes before the throne.” And so on for dreary pages."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f8e8c107-7475-438f-bea2-4e8e9b80a6dc",
                                                "sense_id": "6a28e526-45d9-3830-8f94-0189949310c6",
                                                "text": "But in the United States the whole movement has hardly reached the stage of toleration. It seems difficult for the great body of well-meaning, native-born citizens of mature vears, who are not of the wage-earning order, to understand how enormous have been the changes in the very frame-work of industrial life, and in the simplest and most primal facts affecting the social conditions in which the wage- workers, especially of the great cities and manufacturing sections of the land, now find themselves, year by year, more and more completely environed. The successful middle-aged American carries within his memory, as a rule, associations as to his own early struggles quite at variance with those that would now wait on him were he about to enter the arena of competition, armed only with such forcesas his natural physical nowers, partial training, and moderately developed mental capacities, might afford him at this time. Failing to put himself in the other man’s place, the matured man of business is almost invariably narrow and unjust in his estimate of the motives and aims of the labor-union organizer. There is also a justifiable feeling against the effort to make metes and bounds in the way of class distinctions."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "53c29e31-26bc-426f-b2f5-b4e1fd80aeab",
                                                "sense_id": "6a28e526-45d9-3830-8f94-0189949310c6",
                                                "text": "“I think I trigger a lot of their primal rage,” Mr. Greenwald said, referring to Brazilians who support the president. “They view me as someone who deserves to be punished.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "79e6c489-1f36-34b1-80f3-aca25ce71c27",
                                        "entry_id": "65a6287d-f3aa-3293-a634-175212fc2468",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Being one of the pieces of meat initially separated from the carcass during butchering, prior to division into smaller cuts."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "primal",
